{"id": "5691932b-54f1-46d7-a362-02dabcfba5ce", "slug": "exclusive-web3-network-4", "title": "Exclusive Web3 Network", "description": "Exclusive Web3 Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Exclusive Web3 Network\"\ndescription: \"Exclusive Web3 Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#3B82F6\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#60A5FA\"\n  background: \"#030303\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Space Grotesk\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Geist\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Exclusive Web3 Network\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 19; favorites: 15; remixes: 0.\nTags: feature, section, animated, cta, bento, charts.\n## Overview\nExclusive Web3 Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nThe exclusive Web3 network to connect, create & dominate Exclusive collective for pioneers shaping the decentralized web. Join Network Schedule Demo Michael K. Investor Sarah J. Developer David R. Founder Avalanche +2.4…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: The exclusive Web3 network to connect, create & dominate.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #3B82F6, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #60A5FA, background #030303, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Space Grotesk for display moments and Geist for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Exclusive Web3 Network</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r134/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <link id=\"all-fonts-link-font-space-grotesk\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap\">\n    <style id=\"all-fonts-style-font-space-grotesk\">.font-space-grotesk { font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif !important; }</style>\n    <link id=\"all-fonts-link-font-geist\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap\">\n    <style id=\"all-fonts-style-font-geist\">.font-geist { font-family: 'Geist', sans-serif !important; }</style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#030303] text-white font-sans antialiased overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-blue-500/30 scroll-smooth\" style=\"font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- Background WebGL/Canvas 3D Mesh with DOM Poster Fallback -->\n    <canvas id=\"three-canvas\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 opacity-40 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #0a0a1a 0%, #030303 100%);\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Subtle Diagonal Background Texture -->\n    <div style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, #ffffff04 0, #ffffff04 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 12px);\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Framed Grid Layout Container -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 max-w-[1200px] mx-auto min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center pt-16 pb-32 border-x border-white/[0.06]\">\n\n        <!-- Frame L-Brackets Top -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-8 h-8 border-t border-l border-white/20 -translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-8 h-8 border-t border-r border-white/20 translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Horizontal Guide Line Top -->\n        <div class=\"absolute top-32 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-white/[0.04] w-full\"></div>\n\n\n        <!-- Hero Heading Section with Divider Frame -->\n        <div class=\"w-full border-b border-white/[0.06] py-6 flex flex-col items-center px-6 z-20 relative\">\n            <!-- Section Intersect Brackets -->\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-4 h-4 border-b border-l border-white/20 -translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-4 h-4 border-b border-r border-white/20 translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n\n            <h1 id=\"hero-title\" class=\"text-5xl md:text-7xl leading-[1.05] tracking-tighter text-center max-w-4xl font-space-grotesk\">\n                The exclusive <span class=\"text-gray-500 font-space-grotesk\">Web3 network</span> to connect, <span class=\"text-gray-500 font-space-grotesk\">create &amp; dominate</span>\n            </h1>\n\n            <p class=\"mt-8 text-gray-400 text-sm md:text-base text-center max-w-lg font-normal reveal-item font-geist\">\n                Exclusive collective for pioneers shaping the decentralized web.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- CTA Section -->\n        <div class=\"w-full py-8 flex justify-center items-center px-6 z-20 relative\">\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-4 reveal-item\">\n                <!-- White Button with glow -->\n                <button class=\"relative group px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-white text-black text-sm font-normal transition-transform hover:scale-105\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-white blur-md opacity-40 group-hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity\"></div>\n                    <span class=\"relative z-10 flex items-center gap-2 font-geist\">\n                        Join Network\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </span>\n                </button>\n\n                <!-- Outlined Button -->\n                <button class=\"px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-transparent border border-white/10 text-white text-sm font-normal hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors font-geist\">\n                    Schedule Demo\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Complex Diagram Section -->\n        <div class=\"relative w-full h-[600px] border-b border-white/[0.06] flex justify-center items-end reveal-item z-20\">\n            <!-- Section Intersect Brackets -->\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-4 h-4 border-b border-l border-white/20 -translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-4 h-4 border-b border-r border-white/20 translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Center Vertical Beam -->\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-[10%] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-px h-[350px] bg-gradient-to-t from-blue-500 via-blue-400/50 to-transparent shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(59,130,246,0.8)] z-10\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Bottom 3D Globe Base (Unclipped) -->\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-[-10%] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[800px] h-[400px] flex justify-center items-center z-0 pointer-events-none\" style=\"perspective: 1000px;\">\n                <!-- 3D Rings forming a globe -->\n                <div class=\"absolute w-[700px] h-[700px] border border-blue-500/40 rounded-full shadow-[0_0_50px_rgba(59,130,246,0.3)_inset]\" style=\"transform: rotateX(75deg);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute w-[600px] h-[600px] border border-blue-500/20 rounded-full\" style=\"transform: rotateX(75deg) translateZ(-20px);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute w-[500px] h-[500px] border border-blue-500/10 rounded-full\" style=\"transform: rotateX(75deg) translateZ(-40px);\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Angular base lines -->\n                <svg width=\"700\" height=\"200\" viewBox=\"0 0 700 200\" fill=\"none\" class=\"absolute bottom-[20%] drop-shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(59,130,246,0.8)]\">\n                    <path d=\"M 50 50 L 350 150 L 650 50\" stroke=\"url(#base-grad)\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\n                    <defs>\n                        <linearGradient id=\"base-grad\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"0%\">\n                            <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"rgba(59,130,246,0)\"></stop>\n                            <stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"rgba(59,130,246,1)\"></stop>\n                            <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"rgba(59,130,246,0)\"></stop>\n                        </linearGradient>\n                    </defs>\n                </svg>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Central Orbs -->\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-[20%] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 flex items-center gap-12 z-20\">\n                <div class=\"w-24 h-24 rounded-full border border-white/5 bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-md flex items-center justify-center transform -rotate-12 opacity-50\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:network-linear\" class=\"text-4xl text-blue-500/30\" stroke-width=\"1\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"w-32 h-32 rounded-full border border-blue-500/30 bg-blue-950/20 backdrop-blur-lg flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(59,130,246,0.2)_inset] z-10 relative\">\n                     <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-full border border-blue-400/50 animate-pulse\"></div>\n\n                     <!-- CSS 3D Cube -->\n                     <div class=\"relative w-12 h-12 z-10\" style=\"transform-style: preserve-3d; transform: rotateX(-20deg) rotateY(45deg);\">\n                         <!-- Front -->\n                         <div class=\"absolute inset-0 border-[1.5px] border-blue-400 bg-blue-900/60 drop-shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(59,130,246,0.8)] flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"transform: translateZ(24px);\">\n                            <div class=\"w-full h-full border border-blue-300/30 m-1\"></div>\n                         </div>\n                         <!-- Back -->\n                         <div class=\"absolute inset-0 border-[1.5px] border-blue-400 bg-blue-900/60\" style=\"transform: rotateY(180deg) translateZ(24px);\"></div>\n                         <!-- Right -->\n                         <div class=\"absolute inset-0 border-[1.5px] border-blue-400 bg-blue-800/60\" style=\"transform: rotateY(90deg) translateZ(24px);\"></div>\n                         <!-- Left -->\n                         <div class=\"absolute inset-0 border-[1.5px] border-blue-400 bg-blue-900/60\" style=\"transform: rotateY(-90deg) translateZ(24px);\"></div>\n                         <!-- Top -->\n                         <div class=\"absolute inset-0 border-[1.5px] border-blue-400 bg-blue-400/30\" style=\"transform: rotateX(90deg) translateZ(24px);\"></div>\n                         <!-- Bottom -->\n                         <div class=\"absolute inset-0 border-[1.5px] border-blue-400 bg-blue-900/60\" style=\"transform: rotateX(-90deg) translateZ(24px);\"></div>\n                     </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"w-24 h-24 rounded-full border border-white/5 bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-md flex items-center justify-center transform rotate-12 opacity-50\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chart-2-linear\" class=\"text-4xl text-green-500/30\" stroke-width=\"1\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Connectors (SVG) -->\n            <svg class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full z-10 pointer-events-none\" style=\"filter: drop-shadow(0 0 4px rgba(255,255,255,0.3));\">\n                <!-- Left connecting line -->\n                <path d=\"M 380 280 L 450 280 L 500 350\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.4)\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n                <circle cx=\"380\" cy=\"280\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#60A5FA\"></circle>\n                <circle cx=\"500\" cy=\"350\" r=\"2\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.4)\"></circle>\n\n                <!-- Right connecting line -->\n                <path d=\"M 820 280 L 750 280 L 700 350\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.4)\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n                <circle cx=\"820\" cy=\"280\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#60A5FA\"></circle>\n                <circle cx=\"700\" cy=\"350\" r=\"2\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.4)\"></circle>\n            </svg>\n\n            <!-- Left Floating Cards (Users) -->\n            <div class=\"absolute left-4 md:left-24 top-[30%] flex flex-col gap-6 z-20\">\n                <!-- Inactive Card -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-2 pr-6 rounded-full bg-black/50 border border-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm opacity-40\">\n                    <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gray-800 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden\">\n                        <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/2f563338-39fa-47ea-9761-658d4f3f84db_800w.jpg\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" alt=\"User Avatar\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <div class=\"text-xs font-normal text-white font-geist\">Michael K.</div>\n                        <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 font-geist\">Investor</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Active Card with Border Gradient & Mask -->\n                <div class=\"relative group ml-12\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute -inset-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-purple-600 rounded-full opacity-70 blur-[2px]\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute -inset-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 to-purple-500 rounded-full\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"relative flex items-center gap-3 p-2 pr-8 rounded-full bg-[#0a0a0a] backdrop-blur-xl shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(59,130,246,0.3)]\">\n                        <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-900/50 flex items-center justify-center border border-blue-500/30 overflow-hidden\">\n                            <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/4f5668c5-fc4a-44e0-bc5e-a664189d3c31_800w.jpg\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" alt=\"Sarah J. Avatar\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div>\n                            <div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-white tracking-tight font-geist\">Sarah J.</div>\n                            <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 font-geist\">Developer</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                 <!-- Inactive Card -->\n                 <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-2 pr-6 rounded-full bg-black/50 border border-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm opacity-40\">\n                    <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gray-800 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden\">\n                        <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/eca707cc-a5b7-439a-b4fd-247f6106c2e1_800w.jpg\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" alt=\"User Avatar\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <div class=\"text-xs font-normal text-white font-geist\">David R.</div>\n                        <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 font-geist\">Founder</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right Floating Cards (Chains) -->\n            <div class=\"absolute right-4 md:right-24 top-[20%] flex flex-col gap-12 z-20\">\n                 <!-- Inactive Card (Avalanche) -->\n                 <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-2 pr-6 rounded-full bg-black/50 border border-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm opacity-60 ml-8\">\n                    <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-orange-500/20 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-bolt-linear\" class=\"text-orange-400 text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <div class=\"text-xs font-normal text-white font-geist\">Avalanche</div>\n                        <div class=\"text-xs text-green-400 font-geist\">+2.4%</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Active Card with Border Gradient (Polygon) -->\n                <div class=\"relative group mr-12\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute -inset-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-indigo-600 rounded-full opacity-70 blur-[2px]\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute -inset-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-500 to-indigo-500 rounded-full\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"relative flex items-center gap-3 p-2 pr-8 rounded-full bg-[#0a0a0a] backdrop-blur-xl shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(168,85,247,0.2)]\">\n                        <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-purple-900/50 flex items-center justify-center border border-purple-500/30\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:code-circle-linear\" class=\"text-purple-400 text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                        <div>\n                            <div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-white tracking-tight font-geist\">Polygon</div>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                                <span class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 font-geist\">$0.89</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-xs text-red-400 font-geist\">-0.12%</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Inactive Card (Chainlink) -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-2 pr-6 rounded-full bg-black/50 border border-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm opacity-40 ml-4\">\n                    <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-500/20 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                         <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:link-circle-linear\" class=\"text-blue-400 text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <div class=\"text-xs font-normal text-white font-geist\">Chainlink</div>\n                        <div class=\"text-xs text-green-400 font-geist\">+1.2%</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Frame L-Brackets Bottom -->\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-8 h-8 border-b border-l border-white/20 -translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-8 h-8 border-b border-r border-white/20 translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // --- WebGL 3D Three.js Network Background ---\n        // Remixed Implementation: Retro-futurist ShaderMaterial Plane with layered spatial depth, lighting & slow orbital drift\n        const initThreeJS = () => {\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('three-canvas');\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n\n            // Perspective, ~75deg FOV\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(75, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n\n            // alpha, antialias, DPR clamp\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas: canvas, alpha: true, antialias: true });\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n\n            // Geometry: high-segment plane for displacement\n            const geometry = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(100, 100, 128, 128);\n\n            // Materials: ShaderMaterial with ambient + key + rim lighting via uniforms\n            const material = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\n                extensions: { derivatives: true },\n                transparent: true,\n                wireframe: false,\n                uniforms: {\n                    uTime: { value: 0 },\n                    uColor: { value: new THREE.Color('#030303') },\n                    uGridColor: { value: new THREE.Color('#3b82f6') },\n                    uKeyLightPos: { value: new THREE.Vector3(10.0, 10.0, 10.0) },\n                    uRimLightPos: { value: new THREE.Vector3(-10.0, 5.0, -10.0) }\n                },\n                vertexShader: `\n                    varying vec2 vUv;\n                    varying vec3 vPosition;\n                    uniform float uTime;\n\n                    void main() {\n                        vUv = uv;\n                        vec3 pos = position;\n\n                        // Layered spatial depth displacement simulating retro-futurist terrain\n                        float elevation = sin(pos.x * 0.3 + uTime * 0.2) * 2.0\n                                        + cos(pos.y * 0.3 + uTime * 0.15) * 2.0\n                                        + sin(pos.x * 0.8 - uTime * 0.4) * 0.5;\n                        pos.z += elevation;\n\n                        vPosition = (modelMatrix * vec4(pos, 1.0)).xyz;\n                        gl_Position = projectionMatrix * modelViewMatrix * vec4(pos, 1.0);\n                    }\n                `,\n                fragmentShader: `\n                    varying vec2 vUv;\n                    varying vec3 vPosition;\n\n                    uniform float uTime;\n                    uniform vec3 uColor;\n                    uniform vec3 uGridColor;\n                    uniform vec3 uKeyLightPos;\n                    uniform vec3 uRimLightPos;\n\n                    void main() {\n                        // Technical retro-grid pattern\n                        vec2 grid = abs(fract(vUv * 60.0 - 0.5) - 0.5) / fwidth(vUv * 60.0);\n                        float line = min(grid.x, grid.y);\n                        float gridAlpha = 1.0 - min(line, 1.0);\n\n                        // Compute flat normals dynamically from displaced geometry\n                        vec3 dFdxPos = dFdx(vPosition);\n                        vec3 dFdyPos = dFdy(vPosition);\n                        vec3 faceNormal = normalize(cross(dFdxPos, dFdyPos));\n\n                        // Lighting Calculation: Ambient\n                        vec3 ambient = uColor * 0.6;\n\n                        // Lighting Calculation: Key\n                        vec3 keyDir = normalize(uKeyLightPos - vPosition);\n                        float keyDiff = max(dot(faceNormal, keyDir), 0.0);\n                        vec3 key = uGridColor * keyDiff * 0.7;\n\n                        // Lighting Calculation: Rim\n                        vec3 viewDir = normalize(cameraPosition - vPosition);\n                        vec3 rimDir = normalize(uRimLightPos - vPosition);\n                        float rimDot = 1.0 - max(dot(viewDir, faceNormal), 0.0);\n                        float rimAmount = smoothstep(0.5, 1.0, rimDot) * max(dot(faceNormal, rimDir), 0.0);\n                        vec3 rim = vec3(0.5, 0.2, 1.0) * rimAmount * 1.5; // Futuristic purple rim highlight\n\n                        vec3 finalColor = ambient + key + rim;\n\n                        // Add emissive technical grid lines\n                        finalColor += mix(vec3(0.0), uGridColor, gridAlpha) * 0.4;\n\n                        // Fog / Depth fade\n                        float dist = length(cameraPosition - vPosition);\n                        float fade = 1.0 - smoothstep(10.0, 35.0, dist);\n\n                        gl_FragColor = vec4(finalColor, fade);\n                    }\n                `\n            });\n\n            const plane = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material);\n            plane.rotation.x = -Math.PI / 2;\n            plane.position.y = -3;\n            scene.add(plane);\n\n            const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n\n            const animate = () => {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                const time = clock.getElapsedTime();\n\n                material.uniforms.uTime.value = time;\n\n                // Motion: Slow orbital drift\n                const radius = 12;\n                camera.position.x = Math.sin(time * 0.03) * radius;\n                camera.position.z = Math.cos(time * 0.03) * radius;\n                camera.position.y = 4 + Math.sin(time * 0.1) * 1.5;\n                camera.lookAt(0, -2, 0);\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            };\n\n            animate();\n\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            });\n        };\n\n        initThreeJS();\n\n        // --- GSAP Masked Reveal ---\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        const splitTextToSpans = (selector) => {\n            const elements = document.querySelectorAll(selector);\n            elements.forEach(el => {\n                const text = el.innerHTML;\n                const container = document.createElement('div');\n                container.innerHTML = text;\n\n                const processNodes = (node) => {\n                    if (node.nodeType === 3) {\n                        const words = node.nodeValue.split(/(\\s+)/).filter(w => w.length > 0);\n                        const fragment = document.createDocumentFragment();\n                        words.forEach(word => {\n                            if (word.trim() === '') {\n                                fragment.appendChild(document.createTextNode(word));\n                            } else {\n                                const mask = document.createElement('span');\n                                mask.style.display = 'inline-flex';\n                                mask.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n                                mask.style.verticalAlign = 'top';\n\n                                const inner = document.createElement('span');\n                                inner.className = 'reveal-word inline-block';\n                                inner.textContent = word;\n\n                                mask.appendChild(inner);\n                                fragment.appendChild(mask);\n                            }\n                        });\n                        node.parentNode.replaceChild(fragment, node);\n                    } else if (node.nodeType === 1) {\n                        Array.from(node.childNodes).forEach(processNodes);\n                    }\n                };\n\n                Array.from(container.childNodes).forEach(processNodes);\n                el.innerHTML = container.innerHTML;\n            });\n        };\n\n        splitTextToSpans('#hero-title');\n\n        const tl = gsap.timeline();\n\n        tl.from('.reveal-word', {\n            y: '100%',\n            rotationZ: 2,\n            opacity: 0,\n            duration: 0.8,\n            stagger: 0.04,\n            ease: \"power4.out\",\n            delay: 0.2\n        })\n        .from('.reveal-item', {\n            y: 20,\n            opacity: 0,\n            duration: 0.8,\n            stagger: 0.1,\n            ease: \"power3.out\"\n        }, \"-=0.4\");\n\n    </script>\n\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "exclusive-web3-network-4.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/exclusive-web3-network-4.jpg", "source_name": "exclusive-web3-network-4-DESIGN.md", "views": 103, "forks": 4, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-06-29T05:58:47.989621+00:00"}